{"id":"pues","lemma":"pues","pos":"conj","rank":215,"glosses":["so, then; in that case","because, since"],"ipa":"/ˈpwes/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-pues.wav","examples":[{"text":"Pues yo también tengo hambre.","en":"I'm kind of hungry, too.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/456672","words":[null,null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,3,"me too"],[3,5,"I'm hungry"]]},{"text":"Pues, ¿es todo por hoy?","en":"Well, shall we call it a day?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/64544","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"all"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"for now"]]},{"text":"Pues claro que iré a la fiesta.","en":"Of course, I'll be at the party.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/765021","words":[null,{"g":"clear"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"party"}]},{"text":"-Necesito más. -Pues no hay más.","en":"\"I need more.\" \"Well, there's no more.\"","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/541248","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"more"}]},{"text":"Voy a la piscina, pues hace buen tiempo.","en":"The weather's nice, so I'm going to the pool.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/770133","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"swimming pool"},null,{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null,{"g":"time"}]}]}